    "title": "The Animal Foundation celebrates over 1,000 adoptions made in September - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Martha Cruz ,\n11 hours ago Las Vegas (KSNV) — Over 1,000 pets at The Animal Foundation found their forever homes last month. In September, shelter officials reported that 1,117 animals were adopted. The total includes 457 cats, 564 dogs, and 96 other animals. An additional 285 pets were also fostered, and 261 were transferred... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 25",
